    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2Cso4WAZSWbQutHMvcAniFJ)_\n\n## What\n\nThe nightly tidy for the PRs merged since last night (#284, #285, #287, #288, #289). The PRs wrote no entries themselves, as agreed, so every line below is new.\n\n- **Being developed (Emacs)**: the keymap line now says #278, #283 and #284 are all merged, that #284 needs trying on the Mac and Linux, and what is still to do; \"Org URLs in browse-url\" is gone (#285 merged); new line for #290 (open, the extra paren that stopped `sp-navi` loading).\n- **Feature sets (Emacs)**: #285 in \"Links in notes\", #289 in \"Note tags\", #288 in \"Reviewing and merging in Magit\".\n- **Root `CHANGELOG.org`**: #287 (ADR 0001 superseded) in the Stow set, and a new set \"One layer key for window managers\" for the non-Emacs part of #284 (AeroSpace, Hammerspoon, i3, sway).\n- **Module docs**: new \"Changes by pull request\" section in `sp-keys` (#284), and bullets for #289 in `sp-org-tag-groups` and `sp-vulpea`.\n\n## Left out on purpose\n\n- #290 is open and gets its line when it merges; #286 was the previous tidy.\n- The \"Emacs hangs at start\", SVG-chips, DEVONthink, palette and listening lines are unchanged: nothing new merged for them.\n\nOnly prose changed, no code blocks, so the `tangle` check should be unaffected.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAhURtzPFib2Qr56NG)_",
