                "message": "CHANGELOG: nightly tidy for 2026-11-05\n\nAdd the PRs merged since the last tidy (#284, #285, #287, #288, #289) to\ntheir feature sets, start the \"One layer key for window managers\" set in\nthe root CHANGELOG.org, bring the keymap line up to date, and put the\nverbose text of #284 and #289 in the module docs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAhURtzPFib2Qr56NG",
